  {
   "id": "sec1-5",
   "section": "Biography",
   "text": "After what he described as a misdiagnosis of gender dysphoria, Walt Heyer underwent gender reassignment surgery and lived for eight years as a woman named Laura Jensen, before detransitioning.",
   "words": 29,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2",
    "Editor 6",
    "Editor 11",
    "Editor 15"
   ],
   "author_words": [
