   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-6",
   "section": "Biography",
   "text": "After his experience, he became a leading proponent of the controversial theory \"that transgender people often experience regret after transitioning, and arguing that what transgender people actually need is 'psychiatric or psychological help.'\"",
   "words": 33,
   "authors": [
