  },
  {
   "id": "sec1-7",
   "section": "Biography",
   "text": "In a 2020 video, Heyer described the source of his gender confusion as \"being cross-dressed, being disciplined with a hardwood floor plank, and being sexually molested.\"",
   "words": 27,
   "authors": [
